WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.020
Movie one two three. Let's count together

00:04.660 --> 00:08.460
Did you know that numbers are everywhere around us?

00:09.260 --> 00:13.700
That's right. They're like invisible superheroes helping us every day

00:14.380 --> 00:20.820
We use numbers to count things like how many apples are in a basket or how many stars are in the sky?

00:21.360 --> 00:28.220
We tell time with numbers whether it's 2 in the afternoon or midnight even our age is a number isn't that amazing?

00:28.640 --> 00:30.640
Numbers are really a big part of our lives

00:31.160 --> 00:38.080
So you see numbers are super important and fun, too. Have you ever wondered why counting is so magical?

00:38.680 --> 00:44.840
Well, let's unravel this mystery together when we're counting. We're not just saying numbers out loud

00:45.080 --> 00:49.640
We're actually organizing the world around us. It's like we're on a grand adventure

00:50.560 --> 00:53.280
exploring a jungle full of knowledge and treasures and

00:53.740 --> 00:59.220
Counting is our compass think about it when you're sharing candies with your friends

00:59.220 --> 01:05.900
you count to make sure everyone gets an equal share or when you're lining up your toy cars you count to see how many you

01:05.900 --> 01:12.300
Have and when you're trying to solve a puzzle counting the pieces can be your first step towards victory

01:12.980 --> 01:16.100
Counting is not just about numbers. It's about understanding

01:17.100 --> 01:21.700
Organizing and discovering it's about finding patterns and making sense of the world

01:21.960 --> 01:27.820
It's about solving problems and achieving goals. So next time you start counting remember this

01:28.520 --> 01:32.640
Counting is like a magic key that opens up a world of knowledge for us

01:33.160 --> 01:37.040
What if I told you that every number has a special place of its own?

01:37.800 --> 01:43.760
Imagine a long line where each number gets its unique spot. This is called a number line

01:43.760 --> 01:47.200
It helps us see the order and position of numbers

01:47.300 --> 01:52.300
The number line is a wonderful tool that helps us understand where each number belongs

01:52.740 --> 01:56.020
So what did we learn today about numbers and counting?

01:56.140 --> 02:02.520
We found out how numbers pop up everywhere discovered the magic of counting and even explored the number line

02:03.060 --> 02:09.140
Remember numbers are our friends and counting is our magic key to understanding the world around us

02:09.300 --> 02:11.300
Keep counting and keep learning

